  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どうかしたのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000410020,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "誹謗中傷ってほどじゃないけど\r\n私に対する嫌な書き込みを見ちゃったの",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100041/1802001000410020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000410030,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "慣れてるとはいえ\r\nやっぱりいい気はしないわよね",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100041/1802001000410030"
  },
  {
    "select": "いい書き込みを\r\n探しておく",
    "nextLabel": "1802001000411"
  },
  {
    "select": "気にしなくていい",
    "nextLabel": "1802001000412"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "見ないほうがいい",
    "nextLabel": "1802001000413"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000410040,
    "label": "1802001000411",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "私に好意的な書き込みを探すつもり？\r\nきっと時間の無駄よ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100041/1802001000410040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000410050,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "でももし見つけられたら\r\nあなたのこと、少しだけ見直すかもしれないわね",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100041/1802001000410050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（よし、楽しく話せたな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000410060,
    "label": "1802001000412",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "そうね、ただの感想だもの\r\n無視するのが一番なのは私もわかってる",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100041/1802001000410060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000410070,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "わかってるけど……\r\n気にしないって、案外難しいのよね",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100041/1802001000410070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（まぁ、普通に話せたかな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000410080,
    "label": "1802001000413",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "そりゃ、見なかったら\r\n嫌な気持ちにもならなかったけど",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100041/1802001000410080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000410090,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "すでに見たあとだから、どうしようもないし\r\n悪口を言われてる事実に変わりはないのよね……",
